config SPI_XLNX_ZYNQ_QSPI
	bool "Xilinx Zynq-7000 QSPI driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_XLNX_ZYNQ_QSPI_1_0_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the Xilinx Zynq-7000 Quad SPI (QSPI) controller driver. The
	  controller is operated as an ordinary single line SPI controller,
	  which is normally used with the QSPI flash device a Zynq-7000 board
	  boots from, but can also be used with other SPI devices. The quad and
	  dual width commands of a flash device are not available this way.
